      "side": 1,
      "message": "Unfortunately this is mostly also true during online indexing, having the ability to disable this during online reindexing would also be useful (which lends itself better to an isWriteEnabled switch insteas of a separate class, see my other comment?)",
      "revId": "d87cee17fb9d4c70d0665bbc1b5aebded121a741",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
